              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഇളക്കുക — iḷakkuka — \"to stir\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഇളക്കുക (iḷakkuka) is native Dravidian, one word with Tamil iḷaku and Kannada eḷadu (DEDR 509). Its first sense is \"to move, to shake\"."
